Note: WatchSend is a fork of OldSend (https://github.com/styisme/oldsend) 
specifically tailored for Wear OS. The underlying protocol stack is inherited 
from OldSend, which is a completely independent implementation written from scratch. 
The UI layer of WatchSend (including dynamic pill cards, 3D scroll effects, and 
predictive back gestures) has been completely rewritten for the watch form factor. 
Neither WatchSend nor OldSend directly copies or modifies the source code of the 
official LocalSend app.
